<div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-xl border border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-500/30 bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-500/10 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Know an emulator we're missing?</h2>
  <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-5 max-w-xl mx-auto">
    If there's a DynamoDB emulator or compatible adapter that isn't tracked here, suggest it. Anything that speaks the
    DynamoDB HTTP API can be run through the same suite and scored against live AWS.
  </p>
  <a
    href="https://github.com/paritysuite/dynamodb-conformance/issues/new?template=suggest-target.yml"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-800 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors">
    Suggest a target
    <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  </a>
</div>
